#NEXUS

[ müller2018z_fig1: Early dinosaur summary tree. Ornithoscelida, Dinosauria, Saurischia and Sauropodomorpha, joined by red arrows to node dots, are kept as internal labels. Fully resolved. 14 tips, fully resolved; 4 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=14;
    TAXLABELS
        Saltopus
        Ornithischia
        Theropoda
        Herrerasauridae
        Saturnalia
        Pampadromaeus
        Pantydraco
        Thecodontosaurus
        Panphagia
        Guaibasaurus
        Chilesaurus
        Efraasia
        Plateosauridae
        other_sauropodomorphs
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE 'müller2018z_fig1' = [&R] (Saltopus,((Ornithischia,Theropoda)Ornithoscelida,(Herrerasauridae,(Saturnalia,(Pampadromaeus,(Pantydraco,((Thecodontosaurus,(Panphagia,Guaibasaurus)),(Chilesaurus,(Efraasia,(Plateosauridae,other_sauropodomorphs)))))))Sauropodomorpha)Saurischia)Dinosauria);
END;
